3
00:00:07.104 --> 00:00:10.543
With a burst of smoke, the dragon leaped into the air.

4
00:00:10.544 --> 00:00:17.504
"Oh!" Boz exclaimed as the little dragon flew at him, snatched the stone out of his hand, and swallowed it.

5
00:00:17.505 --> 00:00:22.285
"Give that back or you'll be sorry, you scaly scoundrel!"

6
00:00:22.286 --> 00:00:27.835
Teplo put a hand on Boz's arm. He had already undone Boz's Lip-Zip spell.

7
