"Settle down, old friend," Teplo said soothingly.

8
00:00:31.683 --> 00:00:36.431
"It won't do any harm to let the boy keep his souvenir, eh?"

9
00:00:36.432 --> 00:00:43.070
Boz glared at Zing and sighed. "I suppose you're right," he said, straightening his clothes.

10
00:00:43.071 --> 00:00:49.575
"Come, Teplo. I promised the king I'd fetch those texts from the archives right away."

11
00:00:49.576 --> 00:00:52.437
Teplo nodded and then glanced at the kids.

12
00:00:52.438 --> 00:00:54.747
"See you at Saffa's in an hour."

13
00:00:54.748 --> 00:00:58.279
