81
00:05:57.536 --> 00:06:00.442
Zann rubbed his fingers to extinguish the light.

82
00:06:00.443 --> 00:06:04.368
Then he lay in the dark, staring at the moonlit ceiling.

83
00:06:04.369 --> 00:06:07.227
He felt guilty about lying to his best friend.

84
00:06:07.228 --> 00:06:17.499
